//! WMI identifier tables, generated from Linux
//! `drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/wmi.h`.
//!
//! Every value below is the C compiler's own evaluation of the Linux
//! enumerator (group bases `WMI_TLV_CMD(grp) = (grp << 12) | 1` and
//! implicit `+1` increments resolved), not a hand transcription. The
//! names are Linux's, verbatim, so a grep in either tree finds the other.
//! `wmi_tests.rs` re-derives a subset by hand from the group bases.
//!
//! Regenerate: extract the enums from wmi.h, compile a printer, and
//! format; do not edit values by hand.

#![allow(missing_docs)]

